A top level that is not a list is rejected; no out directory is created.

-- fixtures/cwd/projects.json --
{"name": "a", "url": "https://pages.example.org/a"}
-- cmd --
sh -c 'booping specs site-index --out site < projects.json; s=$?; test -e site && echo site exists; exit $s'
-- exit --
1
-- stdout --
-- stderr --
error: projects: not a list
